{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/waves-opulence-sobha-hartland","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":474,"crm_id":"126","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Waves Opulence","slug":"waves-opulence-sobha-hartland","display_address":"Sobha Hartland","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2025","developer":"Sobha Realty","price":1950000,"display_price":"","lattitude":25.1754265,"longitude":55.3076337,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":"0","about":"<p>Waves Opulence is a premium project located in the Hartland 1 neighborhood, which is part of the larger MBR City community.</p><p>The development provides residents with a host of world-class amenities, including several state-of-the-art gyms, including an outdoor gym, infinity pool, green gardens and parks with walking and jogging paths, restaurants, a children's playground, a co-working area and a yoga studio.</p><p>Waves Opulence has a convenient location close to Dubai's attractions. The popular UAE Golf Club and The Track Meydan Golf Club are just a 5-minute drive away, while the Burj Khalifa, the Business Bay and Downtown Dubai business districts and the famous The Dubai Fountain show are just 15 minutes away.</p><p>The complex has a unique architecture. The design of the tower is made in a modern style with the use of glass and steel, the interior design of the apartments is characterized by a dim calm design in white and beige colors. Each residence has panoramic windows and balconies offering picturesque views of the waterfront.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/126/images/2023/08/08/94Q5CS60DJd6GAv4BaQqVdJP6zEJJ11mkUpO4KR7.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/08/08/94Q5CS60DJd6GAv4BaQqVdJP6zEJJ11mkUpO4KR7.j